  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">SDG Plattform fas I</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SDGs Platform: Phase I</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The prototype that this Project is going to build is to monitor the SDGs situation and achievements in Colombia. In this sense, filling the gap between Government&#xb4;s actions and citizen&#xb4;s lack of information. This Project aims to improve social dialogue (Swedish Cooperation Strategy in Colombia) through supporting digital tools where citizens can follow Colombia&#xb4;s status about SDGs.  Colombian Government is committed with public information due its chapter 2 about Anti-corruption strategies in the National Development Plan (2014 - 2018).</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsens m&#xe5;l &#xe4;r att skapa en prototyp som &#xe4;mnar vara en f&#xf6;rsta version av en anv&#xe4;ndarv&#xe4;nlig webbplattform som &#xe4;r t&#xe4;nkt att g&#xf6;ra aktuell information tillg&#xe4;nglig f&#xf6;r allm&#xe4;nheten.
Prototypen ligger inom ramen f&#xf6;r Colombias nationella strategi (National utvecklings plan, 2014 - 2018),  f&#xf6;r att n&#xe5; de h&#xe5;llbara utvecklingsm&#xe5;len ( SDG) genom att fr&#xe4;mja transparens i regeringens arbete samt g&#xf6;ra information r&#xf6;rande regeringens arbete med de h&#xe5;llbara utvecklingsm&#xe5;len tillg&#xe4;nglig f&#xf6;r allm&#xe4;nheten.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This contribution is aimed to create a prototype of a virtual platform that visualize the SDGs achievement of the Colombian Government. The institution in charge of it is the National Planning Department. Colombia is one of the countries in the forefront when it comes to SDGs, hence, this countries aso has international agreements to follow.</narrative>
  </description>
